Two tasks:
1. Fix PDF download so all content appears in one continuous document (html2pdf pagebreak issues — content cut off / split badly). Common fixes: use `pagebreak: {mode: ['css','legacy']}` with avoid rules, or better: render to a single long image? Actually "make all the items show in 1 piece document" likely means currently content is missing/cut off in the PDF. html2pdf with html2canvas has issues with tall content and with max-height scroll containers (transcript-box max-height 300px overflow hidden — content clipped!). Also `#resultsSection` etc.

